<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Intellect wins Coles Myer contract.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Intellect wins Coles Myer contract.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intellect Holdings Ltd said on Monday that Coles Myer Ltd's department store Myer Grace would spend more than A$4 million to buy and install Intellect's EFTPOS terminals throughout its stores during early 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The roll-out will make Myer Grace Bros the first major Australian department store group to introduce EFTPOS throughout its stores,&quot; Intellect said.</p>
<p>The terminals are fully smart card-capable.  </p>
<p>Intellect said it had joined with NCR Corp, as systems integrator, to design and install the Myer Grace system. Intellect's share price was down one cent at 97 cents at 2.20 p.m. (0320 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
